Scope: build-identity contract for the OSD sidebar V entry. Checks that BUILD_ID is generated (never a checked-in constant), that its SRC half is a digest of the exact fit inputs so it cannot silently go stale, that a missing git identity is refused by the fit path, and that an RBF md5 resolves to a BUILD_ID through the provenance ledger. It does NOT execute the Quartus Tcl (no tclsh in this lab), does not run a fit, and does not prove the string is rendered on screen — tests/hw/test_osd_build_identity.sh owns the pixel proof.
